    "title": "Trump Standing Up After Being Shot Symbolized American Resilience, Exceptionalism, Strength: Journalist | NTD",
    "text": "Salena Zito, journalist and author, discussed with NTD's Melina Wisecup her new book \"Butler,\" about her firsthand account of the assassination attempt on President Donald Trump nearly one year ago. Zito also discussed Trump's prominent place in American culture through the decades, analyzed the public's eroded trust in American journalism, and called for more diversity of thought in newsrooms.\nTrump Standing Up After Being Shot Symbolized American Resilience, Exceptionalism, Strength: Journalist\nSalena Zito, journalist and author, discussed her new book 'Butler' and her firsthand account of the assassination attempt on President Donald Trump.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 7/9/2025, 11:23:20 PM EDT",
